Subject: [PATCH 1/4] Phase 1: multi-meter feeder, grid-vs-data-quality
 detection, escalation and evaluation

- 5-meter synthetic feeder with 10 labelled events, incl. drop, falsified reading,
  voltage sag and outage; per-event label file
- Rules + physics check (P ~ V*I) + profile deviation + Isolation Forest + feeder
  cross-check separating grid events from data-quality problems
- Heuristic confidence, plain-language explanations, versioned escalation policy
  with over-trust guard, JSONL decision log
- Evaluation: precision/recall/FPR, detection delay, latency, held-out seeds
- Docs: escalation policy, shared-learning protocol, Phase 2 roadmap; remove .idea

