-## Generate the synthetic dataset
-
-```bash
-python src/generate_dataset.py
+readings ─► validation rules ─────────┐
+            physics check (P ≈ V·I) ──┤
+            meter's own usual pattern ┼─► verdict + confidence + explanation ─► escalation policy ─► decision log
+            Isolation Forest ─────────┤        (data quality │ grid event)          (auto │ review │ approval)
+            feeder cross-check ───────┘
 ```
 
-This creates `data/simulated_energy_readings.csv`. The generated dataset contains hourly readings over 30 days and labelled synthetic anomaly intervals. It is not real STEG data or a public measured dataset.
